notation {\n      margin: -1px 0 0 3px;\n      color: #13263b;\n      font-family: \"FangSong\", \"STFangsong\", serif;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n\n    .annotation .red,\n    .red {\n      color: #a42c2f;\n    }\n\n    .blue {\n      color: #17365f;\n    }\n\n    .number {\n      position: relative;\n      top: -8px;\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin-left: 1px;\n      color: #b42235;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .underline-red {\n      border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(167, 34, 42, 0.72);\n    }\n\n    .underline-blue {\n      border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(30, 73, 121, 0.65);\n    }\n\n    .bracket {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: -1px;\n      top: 5px;\n      width: 8px;\n      height: calc(100% - 10px);\n      border-top: 1px solid #34465d;\n      border-right: 1px solid #34465d;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #34465d;\n    }\n\n    aside {\n      min-height: 655px;\n      padding: 1px 0 0 8px;\n      border-left: 1px solid rgba(139, 75, 78, 0.46);\n      color: #142942;\n      font-family: \"FangSong\", \"STFangsong\", serif;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      line-height: 1.43;\n    }\n\n    aside p {\n      margin: 0 0 3px;\n    }\n\n    aside .index {\n      color: #aa2439;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    aside .heading {\n      color: #963040;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    .side-rule {\n      margin: 5px 0;\n      border-top: 1px solid rgba(58, 76, 97, 0.3);\n    }\n\n    .bottom-block {\n      margin-top: 5px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 650px) {\n      body {\n        padding: 6px 0 20px;\n      }\n\n      .sheet {\n        width: 98vw;\n        min-height: 970px;\n        padding: 25px 13px 30px 61px;\n      }\n\n      .spiral {\n        width: 50px;\n        background-size: 50px 35px;\n      }\n\n      .spiral::before {\n        left: 8px;\n        width: 33px;\n        background-size: auto 35px;\n      }\n\n      .page-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 105px;\n        gap: 4px;\n      }\n\n      h1 {\n        font-size: 23px;\n      }\n\n      .author,\n      .subtitle,\n      .intro {\n        font-size: 9px;\n      }\n\n      .classical {\n        font-size: 18px;\n      }\n\n      .classical.small {\n        font-size: 16px;\n      }\n\n      .annotation {\n        font-size: 8px;\n      }\n\n      aside {\n        padding-left: 4px;\n        font-size: 7px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <article class=\"sheet\">\n    <div class=\"spiral\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"title-row\">\n        <span class=\"chapter-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <h1>11. 醉翁亭记</h1>\n        <span class=\"author\">北宋·欧阳修</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">四｜情意深切怡然</p>\n      <div class=\"intro\">\n        <p>欧阳修，号醉翁，晚号六一居士，世称“欧阳文忠公”。</p>\n        <p>北宋文学家、史学家，“唐宋八大家”之一。</p>\n        <p>主修《新唐书》，有《欧阳文忠公集》传世。</p>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"page-grid\">\n      <main>\n        <p class=\"lesson-note\">课文详解</p>\n\n        <section class=\"passage\">\n          <p class=\"classical\">环滁皆山也。<span class=\"number\">①</span></p>\n          <p class=\"annotation\">环绕着滁州城的都是山。　<span class=\"blue\">〔句解：概括滁州全貌。〕</span></p>\n          <div class=\"bracket\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"passage\">\n          <p class=\"classical\">其西南诸峰，林壑尤美，<span class=\"underline-red\">望之蔚然而深秀者</span>，琅琊也。<span class=\"number\">②</span></p>\n          <p class=\"annotation\">它的西南方向的山峰，树林和山谷尤其秀美，远远望去树木茂盛、幽深秀丽的，是琅琊山。</p>\n          <div class=\"bracket\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"passage\">\n          <p class=\"classical\">山行六七里，渐闻水声潺潺，而泻出于两峰之间者，酿泉也。</p>\n          <p class=\"annotation\">沿着山路走六七里，渐渐听到潺潺的水声，又看到水流从两座山峰之间倾泻而下的，是酿泉。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"passage\">\n          <p class=\"classical\">峰回路转，有亭<span class=\"underline-blue\">翼然</span>临于泉上者，醉翁亭也。<span class=\"number\">③</span></p>\n          <p class=\"annotation\">山势回环，路也跟着转弯，有一座亭子四角翘起，像鸟张开翅膀一样，高踞于泉水之上的，是醉翁亭。</p>\n          <div class=\"bracket\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"passage\">\n          <p class=\"classical\">作亭者谁？山之僧曰智仙也。<span class=\"number\">④</span></p>\n          <p class=\"annotation\">造亭子的是谁？是山里的和尚智仙。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"passage bottom-block\">\n          <p class=\"classical\">名之者谁？太守自谓也。<span class=\"number\">⑤</span></p>\n          <p class=\"annotation\">给它命名的是谁？是太守用自己的别号“醉翁”来命名。</p>\n        </section>\n      </main>\n\n      <aside>\n        <p><span class=\"heading\">①环滁（chú）：</span>环绕着滁州城。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"heading\">②蔚然：</span>茂盛的样子。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"heading\">③林壑：</span>树林和山谷。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">④</span>尤：格外。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">⑤</span>蔚然而深秀：树木茂盛，又幽深又秀丽。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">⑥</span>琅琊：山名。</p>\n\n        <div class=\"side-rule\"></div>\n\n        <p><span class=\"index\">①</span>山行：沿着山路。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">②</span>潺潺：流水声。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">③</span>泻出：水流倾泻而出。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">④</span>酿泉：泉名。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">⑤</span>峰回路转：山势回环，路也跟着转弯。</p>\n\n        <div class=\"side-rule\"></div>\n\n        <p><span class=\"index\">①</span>翼然：像鸟张开翅膀一样。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">②</span>临：居高面下。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">③</span>作：建造。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">④</span>名：名词作动词，命名、取名。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"index\">⑤</span>太守自谓：太守用自己的别号来命名。</p>\n      </aside>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</body>\n</html>"
